<title>POLAND: Budimex signs $1.6 mln Czech contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex signs $1.6 mln Czech contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish construction company Budimex SA signed a $1.6 million contract to construct a sewage treatment plant near Prague in Czech Republic, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the works would be carried out from October 10, 1996 to July 31, 1999, but gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
